      "content": "but isn't that exactly the point? he prioritized his own standing and \"national pride\" over the actual lives of the people living through the occupation. it sounds like you're saying his ego was basically a necessary evil for the sake of French sovereignty. can't you see that his actions were more of a moral failure than a pragmatic necessity?",
